### Register admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get current user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create team
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Platform Team",
  "description": "Backend team responsible for workflow services"
}

### Create project
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": 1,
  "name": "TaskFlow API Launch",
  "description": "Prepare the first production-ready backend release.",
  "dueDate": "2026-07-01"
}

### Create task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "title": "Design project endpoints",
  "description": "Define project create, list and update flows.",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2026-06-01"
}

### Move task to in progress
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### List audit logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
